      "body": "`itertools.tee` raises a `RuntimeError`, but generators raise a `ValueError` on re-entrant calls. In https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/150589 I picked `RuntimeError` for `pairwise` re-entrant calls.\n\nI have no strong opinion on the type of error, but lets make it an informed decision and then be consistent. @rhettinger ",
